        warnings: ['Nyāsa activates subtle body energy stations — do not perform casually or absentmindedly', 'The bīja mantras must be pronounced as accurately as possible', 'This practice pairs with the Śrī Yantra Trāṭaka from the previous lesson — do not attempt Nyāsa without prior Trāṭaka experience', 'The Ṣaṭkarma applications of yantra are documented for completeness — the Aghori framework emphasizes internal use only'],
