        warnings: ['Do not draw yantras casually or absentmindedly — the act of drawing is the practice', 'A poorly proportioned Śrī Yantra is considered inactive — use a template until you can draw it accurately', 'Do not discard a consecrated yantra in the trash — immerse in flowing water', 'The consecration requires the Nyāsa skills from the previous lesson — do not skip it'],
