        practice: 'Choose one protective yantra relevant to your current life situation. Draw it on paper or copper plate while chanting its bija. Perform a simple consecration (gaze, 108x japa of the bija, visualize the deity’s presence entering the bindu). Place it in your practice space. Use it as a Trataka object during periods of instability.',
